      "title": "Shift to Git-Based Context Repositories",
      "summary": "Letta (formerly MemGPT) introduced 'Context Repositories' in Feb 2026, utilizing Git-based versioning for agent memory. This allows for concurrent sub-agent memory writes and conflict resolution, significantly improving performance in multi-agent workflows.",
