      "summary": "Newer, lightweight systems like OMEGA have emerged as leaders in the Model Context Protocol (MCP) ecosystem, achieving a 95.4% accuracy on LongMemEval. These systems prioritize SQLite-based local storage over external heavy-weight databases like Neo4j.",
      "supportRefs": [
