        "reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rise of Graph-Enhanced Memory (Mem0g & Graphiti)",
      "summary": "Memory systems now integrate directed labeled graphs to handle temporal reasoning. Zep's Graphiti and Mem0's 'Mem0g' variant show up to 3x performance gains in answering time-sensitive queries compared to flat vector search.",
