    {
      "title": "The Temporal Reasoning Benchmark Conflict",
      "summary": "Both Mem0 and Zep claim supremacy in temporal logic evaluations. In its early 2025 paper, Zep reported a 94.8% score on the Deep Memory Retrieval (DMR) benchmark, edging out MemGPT's 93.4%. Following Mem0's publication of a 67.13% score on the LOCOMO benchmark, Zep released a public rebuttal alleging Mem0 misconfigured Zep's tests, claiming Zep's corrected score was actually 75.14%.",
