      "title": "Shift Towards Hybrid and Graph-Based Architectures",
      "summary": "Standard vector Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is largely deprecated for agentic memory. Vendors are implementing temporal knowledge graphs to handle multi-hop relational queries. Zep's underlying Graphiti library treats memory as temporally evolving nodes and edges, while Mem0 introduced 'Mem0g' utilizing embedded graph databases (like Kuzu) alongside vector stores.",
