      "title": "Action-Based State Management and Self-Editing Memory",
      "summary": "Leading memory systems no longer simply append documents. They operate via atomic CRUD actions. Mem0 evaluates new information and issues UPDATE or DELETE commands to resolve contradictions, mitigating context bloat. Letta achieves similar functionality by supplying agents with specific tool calls to autonomously edit their own memory tiers.",
